  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for initiatives by the St Helena Development Agency to promote the local private sector and attract inward investors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support for initiatives by the St Helena Development Agency to promote the local private sector and attract inward investors is a component of Support to St Helena Development Agency reported by FCDO with a funding type of 108 - Non-budget support financial aid and a budget of &#xA3;1,782,073. It works in the following sector(s): Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development, Trade policy and administrative management.</narrative>
